---
import BaseLayout from '../layouts/BaseLayout.astro';
import { withBase } from '../lib/paths';
---
<BaseLayout title="Site Information — POYARA" description="Important context about POYARA's public project demonstrations, authorship and third-party links.">
  <section class="page-header wrap">
    <p class="eyebrow">SITE INFORMATION / 02</p>
    <h1>Clear about <em>the work.</em></h1>
    <p>Context for interpreting this studio website and its public demonstrations.</p>
  </section>
  <section class="section wrap case-grid">
    <div class="case-main policy-copy">
      <p class="policy-updated">Last updated: October 21, 2026</p>
      <h2>Who this website represents</h2>
      <p>POYARA is the public name of an independent, founder-led product studio. Descriptions of studio work and the founder's experience are presented for professional information. This website does not state a registered corporate identity, office address or jurisdiction.</p>
      <h2>What a demonstration proves</h2>
      <p>A linked technical demonstration is evidence that an interactive prototype can be examined. It is not, by itself, evidence of a customer contract, commercial deployment, certification, performance benchmark or measured business result. Individual project notes explain their own scope and limitations.</p>
      <h2>Content and reuse</h2>
      <p>Original text, layout and artwork on this website are presented as POYARA studio material. Links to source repositories do not change the licensing terms that apply to code or third-party content at those destinations. Check each linked project's license and rights notices before reuse.</p>
      <h2>External links and accuracy</h2>
      <p>External demonstrations and resources may be modified or become unavailable independently of this website. Product descriptions reflect the indicated stage of work and may change as prototypes evolve. Specific project commitments require a separate agreement.</p>
      <h2>Professional enquiries</h2>
      <p>The public professional profile is linked on the <a href={withBase('contact/')}>contact page</a>. A direct studio email and any jurisdiction-specific legal/operator disclosures remain to be verified before formal public launch.</p>
    </div>
    <aside class="case-meta">
      <p class="eyebrow">HOW TO READ THIS SITE</p>
      <div><span>Identity</span><strong>Independent studio brand</strong></div>
      <div><span>Portfolio</span><strong>Public evidence with stated limits</strong></div>
      <div><span>Source repositories</span><strong>Licenses govern reuse</strong></div>
      <div><span>Direct contact</span><strong>Pending verification</strong></div>
      <a class="text-link" href={withBase('privacy/')}>Privacy notice ↗</a>
    </aside>
  </section>
</BaseLayout>
